    "name_raw": "Sense Metals and Minerals",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Heroes of the Darklands pg. 5",
    "definition_raw": "Source Heroes of the Darklands pg. 5\nYou have a sixth sense for the valuable treasures of the earth\n\nBenefit: You gain a +4 bonus on Perception checks to notice natural deposits of precious metals or minerals, and a +4 bonus on Appraise checks to determine their worth. By spending 5 minutes scrutinizing a discovered vein of metals or minerals, you can determine the worth of the full vein to within 1,000 gp, to a maximum of 50,000 gp.",
